```

In `subcategory-list.component.html`:
```html
<ul>
  <li *ngFor="let subcategory of subcategories" (click)="onSelect(subcategory)">
    {{ subcategory.name }}
    <ul *ngIf="subcategory.children">
      <li *ngFor="let child of subcategory.children">
        {{ child.name }}
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

